namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTweenerSequence:Append {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:Append
    src   "Adds the given tween to the end of the Sequence.\nNot support Tweener type: Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started."
    text  "将给定补间添加到序列末尾。\n不支持Tweener类型：Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:AppendCallback {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:AppendCallback
    src   "Fires a callback when the sequence reaches the end of what it holds so far. DOTween's\nAppendCallback: \"slide out, THEN hide the panel\" is one sequence rather than a sequence plus an\nOnComplete that has to know how long the sequence turned out to be.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started."
    text  "当序列到达其当前包含内容的末尾时触发回调。DOTween的\nAppendCallback：“滑出，然后隐藏面板”是一个序列，而不是一个序列加上一个\n必须知道该序列最终长度的OnComplete。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:AppendInterval {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:AppendInterval
    src   "Adds the given interval to the end of the Sequence.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started.\n@param interval The interval duration"
    text  "将给定间隔添加到序列末尾。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。\n@param interval 间隔时长"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:Insert {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:Insert
    src   "Inserts the given tween at the given time position in the Sequence, automatically adding an interval if needed.\nNot support Tweener type: Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started.\n@param timePosition The time position where the tween will be placed"
    text  "将给定补间插入到序列中的指定时间位置，必要时会自动添加间隔。\n不支持Tweener类型：Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。\n@param timePosition 补间放置的时间位置"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:InsertCallback {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:InsertCallback
    src   "Fires a callback at a time position in the sequence, wherever that falls among the tweens.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started."
    text  "在序列中的某个时间位置触发回调，无论该时间位置处于各个补间之间的哪个位置。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:Join {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:Join
    src   "Inserts the given tween at the same time position of the last tween added to the Sequence.\nNote that, in case of a Join after an interval, the insertion time will be the time where the interval starts, not where it finishes.\nNot support Tweener type: Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started."
    text  "将给定补间插入到添加到序列的最后一个补间的同一时间位置。\n请注意，如果在间隔之后执行Join，则插入时间将是间隔开始的时间，而不是间隔结束的时间。\n不支持Tweener类型：Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:Prepend {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:Prepend
    src   "Adds the given tween to the beginning of the Sequence, pushing forward the other nested content.\nNot support Tweener type: Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started."
    text  "将给定补间添加到序列开头，并将其他嵌套内容向后推移。\n不支持Tweener类型：Delay/ DelayFrame/ Virtual。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。"
    state machine
}

DreamTweenerSequence:PrependInterval {
    at    Source/DreamTween/Public/DreamTweenerSequence.h#DreamTweenerSequence:PrependInterval
    src   "Adds the given interval to the beginning of the Sequence, pushing forward the other nested content.\nHas no effect if the Sequence has already started.\n@param interval The interval duration"
    text  "将给定间隔添加到序列开头，并将其他嵌套内容向后推移。\n如果序列已启动，则不起作用。\n@param interval 间隔时长"
    state machine
}
